            { name: "Brass Crossbow", description: "Ranged Weapon Attack: +7 to hit, range 100/400 ft., one target. Hit: 14 (2d10+3) piercing damage, plus one of the following effects (orthon's choice):\n\n1. Acid. The target takes an extra 17 (5d6) acid damage.\n\n2. Blindness (1/Day). The target must succeed on a DC 17 Constitution saving throw or be blinded until the end of the orthon's next turn.\n\n3. Concussion. The target takes an extra 17 (5d6) thunder damage.\n\n4. Entanglement (1/Day). The target must succeed on a DC 17 Strength saving throw or be restrained for 1 hour by strands of sticky webbing. A restrained creature can escape by using an action to make a DC 17 Strength or Dexterity check and succeeding.\n\n5. Paralysis (1/Day). The target must succeed on a DC 17 Constitution saving throw or be paralyzed for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\n\n6. Tracking. The target is marked for 24 hours. While marked, the orthon always knows the direction and distance to the target while they are on the same plane of existence." }
